{"/": "\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>心语沙盘 · 让心情有个小世界</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/style.css?v=13\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/cover.css?v=13\"></head>\n<body class=\"home-page\">\n<main class=\"cover\">\n  <div class=\"cover-scene\">\n    <img class=\"cover-art\" src=\"/static/core/images/cover-wide.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <h1 class=\"cover-wordmark\"><img src=\"/static/core/images/wordmark.svg\" alt=\"心语沙盘\"></h1>\n    <p class=\"cover-intro\">不用急着解释。用物件搭出此刻的感受，<br>AI 会陪你一起看见它。</p>\n    <div class=\"cover-actions\">\n      <a class=\"cover-start\" href=\"/build/\"><span>开始搭建</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 12H28M19 3L28 12L19 21\"/></svg></a>\n      <button class=\"cover-records\" id=\"open-records\"><span>查看我的记录</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 12H28M19 3L28 12L19 21\"/></svg></button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</main>\n<dialog id=\"records-dialog\"><div class=\"dialog-top\"><h2>我的小世界</h2><button id=\"close-records\" class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"关闭记录\">✕</button></div><p class=\"muted\">作品保存在当前浏览器中。</p><div id=\"record-list\"></div></dialog>\n<script src=\"/static/core/home.js?v=2\"></script>\n<script src=\"/static/core/cover-eyes.js?v=5\"></script>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/onboarding.css?v=1\"><script defer src=\"/static/core/onboarding.js?v=1\"></script>\n</body></html>\n\n", "/build/": "\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>搭建我的小世界 · 心语沙盘</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/style.css?v=34\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/build-theme.css?v=34\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/split-view.css?v=34\"><script src=\"/static/core/toy-catalog.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/scene-life.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/scene-world.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/build.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/camera.js?v=34\"></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/ai.css?v=34\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/mascot-motion.css?v=34\"><script defer src=\"/static/core/mascot-motion.js?v=34\"></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/sandbox.css?v=34\"></head>\n<body class=\"build-page\">\n<header class=\"topbar\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"心语沙盘，返回封面\"><img src=\"/static/core/images/wordmark.svg\" alt=\"心语沙盘\"></a><span class=\"top-note\">慢慢摆放，让感受有自己的形状。</span><a class=\"back-link\" href=\"/\">← 返回封面</a></header>\n<main class=\"workspace\">\n<div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>连接实体沙盘</h1></div><span class=\"demo-badge\">✦ 模拟联动演示</span></div>\n<div class=\"setup-grid\">\n<section class=\"panel camera-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"camera-heading\">\n <div class=\"mascot mascot-triangle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n <div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"camera-heading\">01 <span>看见你的沙盘</span></h2><span id=\"camera-state\" class=\"status\">未连接</span></div>\n <div class=\"camera-window\"><video id=\"camera\" autoplay muted playsinline hidden></video><div id=\"camera-placeholder\"><div class=\"camera-illustration\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><h3>等待连接摄像头</h3><p>连接后显示实体沙盘画面</p></div><div id=\"recognition-overlay\" aria-label=\"沙具识别结果\"></div><span class=\"camera-label\">本机画面预览 · 不上传</span></div>\n <div class=\"camera-actions\"><button class=\"button dark\" id=\"connect-camera\">▣ 连接摄像头</button><button class=\"button quiet\" id=\"stop-camera\" hidden>关闭摄像头</button></div>\n <div class=\"camera-device\"><label for=\"camera-device\">摄像头</label><select id=\"camera-device\"><option value=\"\">浏览器默认摄像头</option></select></div>\n <p id=\"camera-message\" class=\"helper\" role=\"status\">连接摄像头后开启沙具外观匹配，也可以手动搭建。</p>\n <p id=\"camera-diagnostic\" class=\"camera-diagnostic\" role=\"status\" hidden></p>\n <details class=\"camera-help\"><summary>沙具识别设置 <span id=\"appearance-indicator\">· 连接后开启</span></summary><div class=\"card-controls\"><button id=\"toggle-appearance\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">开始识别沙具</button><button id=\"learn-appearance\" type=\"button\">框选补充实拍参考</button><button id=\"cancel-learning\" type=\"button\" hidden>取消框选</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"companion-privacy\">数据与隐私</button><button id=\"forget-references\" type=\"button\">清除本机实拍参考</button></div><p id=\"ai-vision-status\" role=\"status\">连接后自动识别沙具，小语会陪你一起搭建。</p><p id=\"appearance-status\" role=\"status\">连接后自动按设计图中的 63 种沙具外观进行匹配；不是二维码识别。</p><p>当前采用参考图外观匹配，尚未训练多角度实物模型。让沙具正面对准镜头并留出间距；实物和设计图差异大时，框选补充实拍参考。点击识别框可纠正名称或忽略误认。</p><p>本机匹配和补充参考在当前浏览器处理。允许小语观察后，摄像头画面会每15秒压缩发送给DeepSeek一次；关闭摄像头即停止。位置对应画面中的相对位置，尚未校准实体沙盘透视；短暂遮挡保留摆放，持续离开后记录移除。</p><ol><li>检查镜头隐私滑盖和摄像头开关。</li><li>选择电脑内置摄像头，避免虚拟或红外镜头；关闭占用摄像头的会议软件。</li><li>如果画面仍黑，用 Windows「相机」检查权限和硬件，测试后关闭相机应用再重连。</li></ol></details>\n <div id=\"xiaoyu-speech\" class=\"xiaoyu-speech\" aria-label=\"小语的话\" hidden><span class=\"cloud-spark cloud-spark-one\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"cloud-spark cloud-spark-two\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✧</span><button id=\"close-xiaoyu-speech\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"收起小语的话\">×</button><p id=\"companion-line\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><p id=\"companion-question\"></p><div class=\"xiaoyu-voice\"><button id=\"voice-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">听小语说</button><button id=\"voice-input\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">说一说</button><button id=\"voice-cancel\" type=\"button\" hidden>取消</button></div><span id=\"speech-provider-status\" class=\"speech-provider-status\" role=\"status\"></span><form id=\"xiaoyu-text-form\"><input id=\"xiaoyu-text\" maxlength=\"800\" aria-label=\"告诉小语\" placeholder=\"也可以打字告诉小语…\"><button type=\"submit\">发送</button></form><div class=\"ai-inline\"><span id=\"ai-mode-status\" role=\"status\">小语陪你慢慢搭建</span></div><span id=\"recognition-state\" class=\"sr-only\"></span><span id=\"voice-status\" class=\"voice-input-status\" role=\"status\"></span></div>\n <div class=\"mascot mascot-yellow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n <div class=\"mascot mascot-friends\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"小语，点击听我说\" data-mood=\"idle\" title=\"小语 · 点击听我说\"><div class=\"mascot-pink\"><svg class=\"xiaoyu-portrait\" viewBox=\"0 0 430 180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"160\" cy=\"176\" rx=\"146\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#a66b6b\" opacity=\".1\"/><svg class=\"xiaoyu-frame xiaoyu-frame-idle\" x=\"8\" y=\"18\" width=\"304\" height=\"157\" viewBox=\"48 28 245 138\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><defs><clipPath id=\"xiaoyu-clip-idle\" clipPathUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M50 146C50 93 87 48 142 35C181 24 224 38 255 68C277 90 289 118 290 145Q292 160 276 161H66Q49 161 50 146Z\"/></clipPath></defs><image href=\"/static/core/images/xiaoyu-expressions.png\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1144\" height=\"184\" clip-path=\"url(#xiaoyu-clip-idle)\"/></svg><svg class=\"xiaoyu-mouth xiaoyu-mouth-talk\" x=\"130\" y=\"125\" width=\"61\" height=\"39\" viewBox=\"422 110 50 42\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><defs><mask id=\"xiaoyu-mouth-talk-mask\"><ellipse cx=\"447\" cy=\"132\" rx=\"25\" ry=\"21\" fill=\"white\"/></mask></defs><image href=\"/static/core/images/xiaoyu-expressions.png\" width=\"1144\" height=\"184\" mask=\"url(#xiaoyu-mouth-talk-mask)\"/></svg><svg class=\"xiaoyu-mouth xiaoyu-mouth-small\" x=\"130\" y=\"125\" width=\"61\" height=\"39\" viewBox=\"688 113 50 42\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><defs><mask id=\"xiaoyu-mouth-small-mask\"><ellipse cx=\"713\" cy=\"134\" rx=\"25\" ry=\"21\" fill=\"white\"/></mask></defs><image href=\"/static/core/images/xiaoyu-expressions.png\" width=\"1144\" height=\"184\" mask=\"url(#xiaoyu-mouth-small-mask)\"/></svg></svg></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel scene-panel\" aria-label=\"选择场景与数字沙盘\">\n<div id=\"scene-picker\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"scene-heading\">02 <span>立体搭建 · 选择场景</span></h2><a id=\"open-online-sand\" class=\"online-sand-entry\" href=\"/sandbox/\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span> 进入线上沙盘 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div id=\"scene-list\" class=\"scene-list\"></div><p class=\"scene-foot\">选择场景后，在这里查看数字沙盘；左侧摄像头持续预览。</p></div>\n<section id=\"digital-view\" class=\"world-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"world-heading\" hidden>\n <div class=\"world-heading\"><div><h2 id=\"world-heading\" tabindex=\"-1\">数字沙盘 <span id=\"world-name\">自然探险</span></h2></div><div class=\"world-actions\"><button class=\"button quiet\" id=\"change-scene\">更换场景</button><button class=\"button quiet\" id=\"clear-world\">清空</button><button class=\"button yellow\" id=\"save-world\">保存 ↗</button></div></div>\n <div class=\"play-layout\"><aside class=\"simulation\"><div class=\"simulation-title\"><span class=\"demo-dot\"></span><h3>手动沙具</h3></div><p>暂停摄像头识别后，可手动选择沙具、拖动调整摆放。</p><div id=\"toy-list\" class=\"toy-list\"></div><div class=\"tray-heading\"><span>模拟桌面 · 俯视</span><span id=\"toy-count\">0 件沙具</span></div><div id=\"input-tray\" class=\"input-tray\" aria-label=\"模拟实体摆放区\"></div><p class=\"tiny\">选中沙具后可用方向键移动，Delete 删除。</p><button class=\"button sample-button\" id=\"sample-world\">✧ 摆一个示例看看</button></aside>\n <div class=\"digital-stage\"><div class=\"stage-top\"><span><i class=\"live-dot\"></i> 数字场景实时联动</span><span>模拟数据</span></div><canvas id=\"world-canvas\" aria-label=\"数字沙盘预览，位置与模拟桌面同步\"></canvas><div id=\"world-empty\" class=\"world-empty\">把第一件沙具放进这个世界<br><small>慢慢摆放，让故事发生</small></div><div class=\"stage-bottom\"><span id=\"selection-info\">点击场景中的沙具可以选中</span><button id=\"remove-toy\" class=\"remove-button\" hidden>移除选中沙具 ×</button></div></div></div>\n <p class=\"world-explanation\"><span id=\"input-source-note\">手动搭建 · 连接摄像头可开启外观匹配</span> <button id=\"finish-session\" type=\"button\">完成并回顾 →</button> <button id=\"open-operation-log\" type=\"button\">操作记录 <span id=\"operation-count\">0</span></button></p>\n</section>\n<div class=\"mascot mascot-purple\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer>心语沙盘 <span>小语陪你慢慢搭建。</span><span>外观匹配版 / 03</span></footer>\n</main><div id=\"toast\" class=\"toast\" role=\"status\" hidden></div>\n<dialog id=\"operation-log-dialog\"><div class=\"dialog-top\"><h2>摆放操作记录</h2><button id=\"close-operation-log\" class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"关闭操作记录\">✕</button></div><p class=\"muted\">只记录物件、相对位置和时间，不分析情绪。最多保留最近 2000 条；坐标范围为 0–1，基于摄像头画面或模拟桌面。</p><ol id=\"operation-log-list\"></ol><button id=\"download-operation-log\" type=\"button\">下载 JSON 记录</button></dialog>\n<dialog id=\"recognition-dialog\"><div class=\"dialog-top\"><h2 id=\"reference-title\">纠正沙具名称</h2><button id=\"close-recognition-dialog\" class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"关闭沙具纠正\">✕</button></div><canvas id=\"reference-preview\" aria-label=\"框选的沙具实拍参考\"></canvas><label for=\"recognition-type\">这是什么沙具？</label><select id=\"recognition-type\"></select><p class=\"muted\">这张实拍参考仅保存在当前浏览器，用于匹配类似角度的外观。选择名称由你确认，不代表系统已经认对。</p><div class=\"card-controls\"><button id=\"save-reference\" type=\"button\">更正并记住外观</button><button id=\"ignore-recognition\" type=\"button\">忽略这次误认</button></div></dialog>\n<script src=\"/static/core/corpus-map.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/xiaoyu-speech.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/sandplay-ai.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/appearance.js?v=34\"></script>\n<dialog id=\"ai-consent-dialog\" class=\"ai-dialog\"><h2>连接前，和你说一声</h2><p>小语已经在这里陪你搭建。为了结合沙盘回应，文字对话、沙具类型、位置和操作记录会经服务端发送给 DeepSeek。</p><p>连接摄像头后，将自动每15秒发送一张压缩画面来识别沙具，不需要手动框选。请让镜头只对准沙盘，避开人脸、身体、姓名等个人信息。关闭摄像头即停止发送画面，也可在“数据与隐私”中改为仅本机陪伴。</p><p>小语说出的话会发送至 MiniMax 合成声音。点击“说一说”后，你的录音也会发送至 MiniMax 转成文字，再交给小语回答；不向 MiniMax 发送摄像头画面。每次最多60秒，说完点“结束并发送”，点取消则不发送。声音是AI合成的，可随时关闭语音。</p><p>作品和对话保存在当前浏览器。DeepSeek和MiniMax会各按其服务条款处理收到的数据。小语帮助你表达，不做心理诊断。未成年用户请和家长或老师一起了解此说明。</p><div class=\"card-controls\"><button id=\"ai-cancel-consent\">仅本机预览</button><button id=\"ai-confirm-consent\">同意并连接摄像头</button></div></dialog>\n<script defer src=\"/static/core/ai-bridge.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/voice-input.js?v=34\"></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/onboarding.css?v=1\"><script defer src=\"/static/core/onboarding.js?v=1\"></script></body></html>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "/sandbox/": "\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>线上沙盘 · 心语沙盘</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/style.css?v=34\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/build-theme.css?v=34\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/split-view.css?v=34\"><script src=\"/static/core/toy-catalog.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/scene-life.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/scene-world.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/build.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/camera.js?v=34\"></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/ai.css?v=34\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/mascot-motion.css?v=34\"><script defer src=\"/static/core/mascot-motion.js?v=34\"></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/sandbox.css?v=34\"></head>\n<body class=\"build-page online-mode\">\n<header class=\"topbar\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"心语沙盘，返回封面\"><img src=\"/static/core/images/wordmark.svg\" alt=\"心语沙盘\"></a><span class=\"top-note\">慢慢摆放，让感受有自己的形状。</span><a class=\"back-link\" href=\"/build/\">← 返回实体搭建</a></header>\n<main class=\"workspace\">\n<div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>我的线上小沙盘</h1><p class=\"online-intro\">挑一个小摆件，把故事轻轻放进来。</p></div><div class=\"online-heading-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/static/core/toys/tree.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/static/core/toys/house.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"/static/core/toys/dog.png\" alt=\"\"></div><span class=\"demo-badge\">✦ 自由搭建小世界</span></div>\n<div class=\"setup-grid\">\n<section class=\"panel camera-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"camera-heading\">\n <div class=\"mascot mascot-triangle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n <div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"camera-heading\">01 <span>看见你的沙盘</span></h2><span id=\"camera-state\" class=\"status\">未连接</span></div>\n <div class=\"camera-window\"><video id=\"camera\" autoplay muted playsinline hidden></video><div id=\"camera-placeholder\"><div class=\"camera-illustration\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><h3>等待连接摄像头</h3><p>连接后显示实体沙盘画面</p></div><div id=\"recognition-overlay\" aria-label=\"沙具识别结果\"></div><span class=\"camera-label\">本机画面预览 · 不上传</span></div>\n <div class=\"camera-actions\"><button class=\"button dark\" id=\"connect-camera\">▣ 连接摄像头</button><button class=\"button quiet\" id=\"stop-camera\" hidden>关闭摄像头</button></div>\n <div class=\"camera-device\"><label for=\"camera-device\">摄像头</label><select id=\"camera-device\"><option value=\"\">浏览器默认摄像头</option></select></div>\n <p id=\"camera-message\" class=\"helper\" role=\"status\">连接摄像头后开启沙具外观匹配，也可以手动搭建。</p>\n <p id=\"camera-diagnostic\" class=\"camera-diagnostic\" role=\"status\" hidden></p>\n <details class=\"camera-help\"><summary>沙具识别设置 <span id=\"appearance-indicator\">· 连接后开启</span></summary><div class=\"card-controls\"><button id=\"toggle-appearance\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">开始识别沙具</button><button id=\"learn-appearance\" type=\"button\">框选补充实拍参考</button><button id=\"cancel-learning\" type=\"button\" hidden>取消框选</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"companion-privacy\">数据与隐私</button><button id=\"forget-references\" type=\"button\">清除本机实拍参考</button></div><p id=\"ai-vision-status\" role=\"status\">连接后自动识别沙具，小语会陪你一起搭建。</p><p id=\"appearance-status\" role=\"status\">连接后自动按设计图中的 63 种沙具外观进行匹配；不是二维码识别。</p><p>当前采用参考图外观匹配，尚未训练多角度实物模型。让沙具正面对准镜头并留出间距；实物和设计图差异大时，框选补充实拍参考。点击识别框可纠正名称或忽略误认。</p><p>本机匹配和补充参考在当前浏览器处理。允许小语观察后，摄像头画面会每15秒压缩发送给DeepSeek一次；关闭摄像头即停止。位置对应画面中的相对位置，尚未校准实体沙盘透视；短暂遮挡保留摆放，持续离开后记录移除。</p><ol><li>检查镜头隐私滑盖和摄像头开关。</li><li>选择电脑内置摄像头，避免虚拟或红外镜头；关闭占用摄像头的会议软件。</li><li>如果画面仍黑，用 Windows「相机」检查权限和硬件，测试后关闭相机应用再重连。</li></ol></details>\n <div id=\"xiaoyu-speech\" class=\"xiaoyu-speech\" aria-label=\"小语的话\" hidden><span class=\"cloud-spark cloud-spark-one\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span><span class=\"cloud-spark cloud-spark-two\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✧</span><button id=\"close-xiaoyu-speech\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"收起小语的话\">×</button><p id=\"companion-line\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><p id=\"companion-question\"></p><div class=\"xiaoyu-voice\"><button id=\"voice-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">听小语说</button><button id=\"voice-input\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">说一说</button><button id=\"voice-cancel\" type=\"button\" hidden>取消</button></div><span id=\"speech-provider-status\" class=\"speech-provider-status\" role=\"status\"></span><form id=\"xiaoyu-text-form\"><input id=\"xiaoyu-text\" maxlength=\"800\" aria-label=\"告诉小语\" placeholder=\"也可以打字告诉小语…\"><button type=\"submit\">发送</button></form><div class=\"ai-inline\"><span id=\"ai-mode-status\" role=\"status\">小语陪你慢慢搭建</span></div><span id=\"recognition-state\" class=\"sr-only\"></span><span id=\"voice-status\" class=\"voice-input-status\" role=\"status\"></span></div>\n <div class=\"mascot mascot-yellow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n <div class=\"mascot mascot-friends\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"小语，点击听我说\" data-mood=\"idle\" title=\"小语 · 点击听我说\"><div class=\"mascot-pink\"><svg class=\"xiaoyu-portrait\" viewBox=\"0 0 430 180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><ellipse cx=\"160\" cy=\"176\" rx=\"146\" ry=\"3\" fill=\"#a66b6b\" opacity=\".1\"/><svg class=\"xiaoyu-frame xiaoyu-frame-idle\" x=\"8\" y=\"18\" width=\"304\" height=\"157\" viewBox=\"48 28 245 138\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><defs><clipPath id=\"xiaoyu-clip-idle\" clipPathUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><path d=\"M50 146C50 93 87 48 142 35C181 24 224 38 255 68C277 90 289 118 290 145Q292 160 276 161H66Q49 161 50 146Z\"/></clipPath></defs><image href=\"/static/core/images/xiaoyu-expressions.png\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1144\" height=\"184\" clip-path=\"url(#xiaoyu-clip-idle)\"/></svg><svg class=\"xiaoyu-mouth xiaoyu-mouth-talk\" x=\"130\" y=\"125\" width=\"61\" height=\"39\" viewBox=\"422 110 50 42\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><defs><mask id=\"xiaoyu-mouth-talk-mask\"><ellipse cx=\"447\" cy=\"132\" rx=\"25\" ry=\"21\" fill=\"white\"/></mask></defs><image href=\"/static/core/images/xiaoyu-expressions.png\" width=\"1144\" height=\"184\" mask=\"url(#xiaoyu-mouth-talk-mask)\"/></svg><svg class=\"xiaoyu-mouth xiaoyu-mouth-small\" x=\"130\" y=\"125\" width=\"61\" height=\"39\" viewBox=\"688 113 50 42\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><defs><mask id=\"xiaoyu-mouth-small-mask\"><ellipse cx=\"713\" cy=\"134\" rx=\"25\" ry=\"21\" fill=\"white\"/></mask></defs><image href=\"/static/core/images/xiaoyu-expressions.png\" width=\"1144\" height=\"184\" mask=\"url(#xiaoyu-mouth-small-mask)\"/></svg></svg></div></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel scene-panel\" aria-label=\"选择场景与数字沙盘\">\n<div id=\"scene-picker\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2 id=\"scene-heading\">02 <span>立体搭建 · 选择场景</span></h2><span class=\"small-note\">给小世界换个背景</span></div><div id=\"scene-list\" class=\"scene-list\"></div><p class=\"scene-foot\">选择场景后，在这里查看数字沙盘；左侧摄像头持续预览。</p></div>\n<section id=\"digital-view\" class=\"world-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"world-heading\" hidden>\n <div class=\"world-heading\"><div><h2 id=\"world-heading\" tabindex=\"-1\">数字沙盘 <span id=\"world-name\">自然探险</span></h2></div><div class=\"world-actions\"><button class=\"button quiet\" id=\"change-scene\">更换场景</button><button class=\"button quiet\" id=\"clear-world\">清空</button><button class=\"button yellow\" id=\"save-world\">保存 ↗</button></div></div>\n <div class=\"play-layout\"><aside class=\"simulation\"><div class=\"simulation-title\"><span class=\"demo-dot\"></span><h3>手动沙具</h3></div><p>暂停摄像头识别后，可手动选择沙具、拖动调整摆放。</p><div id=\"toy-list\" class=\"toy-list\"></div><div class=\"tray-heading\"><span>模拟桌面 · 俯视</span><span id=\"toy-count\">0 件沙具</span></div><div id=\"input-tray\" class=\"input-tray\" aria-label=\"模拟实体摆放区\"></div><p class=\"tiny\">选中沙具后可用方向键移动，Delete 删除。</p><button class=\"button sample-button\" id=\"sample-world\">✧ 摆一个示例看看</button></aside>\n <div class=\"digital-stage\"><div class=\"stage-top\"><span><i class=\"live-dot\"></i> 数字场景实时联动</span><span>模拟数据</span></div><canvas id=\"world-canvas\" aria-label=\"数字沙盘预览，位置与模拟桌面同步\"></canvas><div id=\"world-empty\" class=\"world-empty\">把第一件沙具放进这个世界<br><small>慢慢摆放，让故事发生</small></div><div class=\"stage-bottom\"><span id=\"selection-info\">点击场景中的沙具可以选中</span><button id=\"remove-toy\" class=\"remove-button\" hidden>移除选中沙具 ×</button></div></div></div>\n <p class=\"world-explanation\"><span id=\"input-source-note\">手动搭建 · 连接摄像头可开启外观匹配</span> <button id=\"finish-session\" type=\"button\">完成并回顾 →</button> <button id=\"open-operation-log\" type=\"button\">操作记录 <span id=\"operation-count\">0</span></button></p>\n</section>\n<div class=\"mascot mascot-purple\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer>心语沙盘 <span>小语陪你慢慢搭建。</span><span>作品保存在当前浏览器</span></footer>\n</main><div id=\"toast\" class=\"toast\" role=\"status\" hidden></div>\n<dialog id=\"operation-log-dialog\"><div class=\"dialog-top\"><h2>摆放操作记录</h2><button id=\"close-operation-log\" class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"关闭操作记录\">✕</button></div><p class=\"muted\">只记录物件、相对位置和时间，不分析情绪。最多保留最近 2000 条；坐标范围为 0–1，基于摄像头画面或模拟桌面。</p><ol id=\"operation-log-list\"></ol><button id=\"download-operation-log\" type=\"button\">下载 JSON 记录</button></dialog>\n<dialog id=\"recognition-dialog\"><div class=\"dialog-top\"><h2 id=\"reference-title\">纠正沙具名称</h2><button id=\"close-recognition-dialog\" class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"关闭沙具纠正\">✕</button></div><canvas id=\"reference-preview\" aria-label=\"框选的沙具实拍参考\"></canvas><label for=\"recognition-type\">这是什么沙具？</label><select id=\"recognition-type\"></select><p class=\"muted\">这张实拍参考仅保存在当前浏览器，用于匹配类似角度的外观。选择名称由你确认，不代表系统已经认对。</p><div class=\"card-controls\"><button id=\"save-reference\" type=\"button\">更正并记住外观</button><button id=\"ignore-recognition\" type=\"button\">忽略这次误认</button></div></dialog>\n<script src=\"/static/core/corpus-map.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/xiaoyu-speech.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/sandplay-ai.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/appearance.js?v=34\"></script>\n<dialog id=\"ai-consent-dialog\" class=\"ai-dialog\"><h2>连接前，和你说一声</h2><p>小语已经在这里陪你搭建。为了结合沙盘回应，文字对话、沙具类型、位置和操作记录会经服务端发送给 DeepSeek。</p><p>线上沙盘不需要摄像头。小语会结合你选的摆件、位置和自己说的话回应；也可以选择仅本机语料，安静搭建。</p><p>小语说出的话会发送至 MiniMax 合成声音。点击“说一说”后，你的录音也会发送至 MiniMax 转成文字，再交给小语回答；不向 MiniMax 发送摄像头画面。每次最多60秒，说完点“结束并发送”，点取消则不发送。声音是AI合成的，可随时关闭语音。</p><p>作品和对话保存在当前浏览器。DeepSeek和MiniMax会各按其服务条款处理收到的数据。小语帮助你表达，不做心理诊断。未成年用户请和家长或老师一起了解此说明。</p><div class=\"card-controls\"><button id=\"ai-cancel-consent\">仅本机预览</button><button id=\"ai-confirm-consent\">同意并连接摄像头</button></div></dialog>\n<script defer src=\"/static/core/ai-bridge.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/voice-input.js?v=34\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/sandbox.js?v=34\"></script><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/onboarding.css?v=1\"><script defer src=\"/static/core/onboarding.js?v=1\"></script></body></html>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "/cards/": "\n<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>心语沙盘 · 三种识别测试卡</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/cards.css\"></head>\n<body><header><img src=\"/static/core/images/wordmark.svg\" alt=\"心语沙盘\"><h1>三种沙具 · 识别测试卡</h1><p>这是二维码测试，不是根据沙具外观识别。每种卡片先使用一张。</p><div><button id=\"print-cards\">打印测试卡</button><a href=\"/build/\">返回搭建页</a></div></header>\n<main><article><h2>小树</h2><img class=\"qr\" src=\"/static/core/cards/tree.svg\" alt=\"小树测试二维码 XYSP1:tree:01\"><p>自然 · 小树</p><a href=\"/static/core/cards/tree.svg\" download=\"小树测试卡.svg\">下载 SVG</a></article><article><h2>房屋</h2><img class=\"qr\" src=\"/static/core/cards/house.svg\" alt=\"房屋测试二维码 XYSP1:house:01\"><p>建筑 · 房屋</p><a href=\"/static/core/cards/house.svg\" download=\"房屋测试卡.svg\">下载 SVG</a></article><article><h2>人物</h2><img class=\"qr\" src=\"/static/core/cards/person.svg\" alt=\"人物测试二维码 XYSP1:person:01\"><p>人物 · 人物</p><a href=\"/static/core/cards/person.svg\" download=\"人物测试卡.svg\">下载 SVG</a></article></main>\n<section class=\"instructions\"><h2>怎么测试</h2><ol><li>打印后沿卡片外框剪开，保留二维码周围的白边。每个二维码建议宽约 8 厘米，不要折叠。</li><li>在搭建页选择场景、连接摄像头，再打开左侧「测试卡识别与摄像头帮助」，点击「开始识别测试卡」。</li><li>让二维码朝向镜头，保持光线均匀，三张卡片彼此留出间隙。先用一张测试，再增加到三张。</li><li>移动卡片会改变数字场景中的位置；卡片持续离开画面约两秒后，会记录为「离开画面」。短暂遮挡会保留位置。</li><li>位置对应摄像头画面中的相对位置，尚未做桌面透视校准。电脑镜头若看不到桌面，请先竖起卡片朝镜头演示。</li><li>在数字沙盘下方查看、下载操作记录。这里只记录可观察操作，不分析情绪。关闭识别会保留最后一次摆放。</li></ol><p>画面仅在本机浏览器内处理，不上传。请勿把测试卡识别当作真实沙具识别效果。</p></section><script>document.querySelector('#print-cards').onclick=()=>window.print();</script></body></html>\n", "/report/": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>我的沙盘回顾 · 心语沙盘</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/report.css?v=3\"><script src=\"/static/core/toy-catalog.js\"></script><script defer src=\"/static/core/report.js?v=3\"></script><script type=\"module\" src=\"/static/core/report-professional.mjs?v=1\"></script></head><body>\n<header><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/static/core/images/wordmark.svg\" alt=\"心语沙盘\"></a><a id=\"report-back\" href=\"/build/\">← 继续搭建</a></header>\n<main><div class=\"report-heading\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">和小语一起，回头看看</span><h1>我的沙盘创作观察报告</h1><p>依据实际记录回顾创作，结合专业资料提供可选的陪伴活动。</p></div><span class=\"tag\">创作观察 · 非心理测评</span></div>\n<p id=\"report-empty\" hidden>还没有这份回顾。请先<a href=\"/build/\">搭建一个小世界</a>，再点击“完成并回顾”。</p>\n<div id=\"report-content\" hidden><div class=\"report-grid\"><section class=\"card picture-card\"><label for=\"report-title\">给它起个名字</label><input id=\"report-title\" maxlength=\"60\" value=\"我的沙盘故事\"><img id=\"report-image\" alt=\"本次数字沙盘画面\"><div class=\"facts\"><span id=\"report-scene\"></span><span id=\"report-duration\"></span><span id=\"report-count\"></span></div><p class=\"small\">这是数字沙盘的截图，不含摄像头照片。</p><h2>我摆放的物件</h2><div id=\"report-toys\" class=\"chips\"></div><h2>搭建时发生了什么</h2><p id=\"report-statistics\"></p><ol id=\"report-events\"></ol><p class=\"small\">坐标来自画面或模拟桌面，尚未做实体沙盘透视校准；AI识别结果需要核对。</p></section>\n<div class=\"report-right\"><section class=\"card\"><span class=\"tag lavender\">由你来说</span><h2>这个世界，对你来说是什么样的？</h2><p>可以写搭建前后的感受，也可以只写一个故事。没有标准答案，留空也可以。</p><textarea id=\"self-report\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"500\" placeholder=\"我想给这个世界起名叫……因为……\"></textarea><button id=\"save-report-note\">保存我的话</button><p class=\"small\">这里记录的是你自己的表达，不由摄像头推断情绪。</p></section>\n<section class=\"card\"><span class=\"tag\">观察与记录方法 <a href=\"#source-NAEYC\">[NAEYC]</a></span><h2>本次可核对的观察</h2><ul id=\"observation-facts\"></ul><h2>孩子自己的话 · 原样记录</h2><div id=\"child-statements\"></div><p id=\"observation-limits\" class=\"evidence-note\"></p></section><section class=\"card\"><span class=\"tag\">家庭陪伴 · 可选活动</span><h2>下一次可以怎样玩</h2><label for=\"activity-age\">活动建议适用年龄（可选）</label><select id=\"activity-age\"><option value=\"\">未提供年龄</option><option value=\"3-5\">3–5岁</option><option value=\"6-7\">6–7岁</option><option value=\"8-12\">8–12岁</option></select><p id=\"activity-age-note\" class=\"evidence-note\"></p><div id=\"age-activities\"></div><p class=\"evidence-note\">仅在本页切换建议，不保存或上传年龄。活动依据指南原则改编，不是能力测试；不设置达标分数。</p></section><section class=\"card companion-card\"><span id=\"report-provider\" class=\"tag lavender\">本机记录 · 未调用AI</span><h2>AI辅助整理 · 请核对原始记录</h2><p id=\"report-summary\">你已经搭建了一个属于自己的小世界。你愿意说出的内容，会和摆放过程一起留在这里；没有表达的感受，小语不会替你猜。</p><ul id=\"report-suggestions\"></ul><label class=\"consent\"><input id=\"report-consent\" type=\"checkbox\">愿意将本次摆放记录、对话和上方文字发送给 DeepSeek 整理，不发送摄像头图片</label><button id=\"generate-ai-report\">请小语帮我整理</button><p id=\"report-status\" role=\"status\"></p><p class=\"small\">这是一份表达回顾，不是心理测评、诊断或治疗效果报告。</p></section>\n<section class=\"card\"><span class=\"tag\">我们说过的话</span><h2>被认真听见的片段</h2><div id=\"report-dialogue\"></div></section>\n</div></div><div class=\"report-actions\"><button id=\"download-report\">下载回顾 JSON</button><button id=\"print-report\">打印 / 保存为 PDF</button><button id=\"delete-report\" class=\"quiet\">删除本次对话与回顾</button></div><p id=\"save-status\" role=\"status\"></p><details id=\"professional-sources\" class=\"card sources\" open><summary>专业来源与使用范围</summary><p>方法参考不代表机构认可或产品认证。文献说明一般观察与游戏原则，未验证本产品的测评效度或干预效果。本页实际观察来自本次保存记录；活动建议由项目依照下列资料改编。资料核对日期：2026年10月28日。</p><ol id=\"professional-references\"></ol></details></div></main><footer>慢慢搭建，慢慢表达。你的故事，由你来讲。</footer></body></html>\n", "/feedback/": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>我的创作纪念 · 心语沙盘</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/core/feedback.css?v=4\"><script src=\"/static/core/toy-catalog.js\"></script><script type=\"module\" src=\"/static/core/feedback.js?v=4\"></script></head><body>\n<header><a href=\"/\" aria-label=\"心语沙盘首页\"><img src=\"/static/core/images/wordmark.svg\" alt=\"心语沙盘\"></a><a id=\"continue-build\" href=\"/build/\">← 继续搭建</a></header>\n<main><section id=\"feedback-missing\" hidden><h1>还没有找到这份作品</h1><p>作品保存在创建它的浏览器中。</p><a href=\"/build/\">去搭建一个小世界 →</a></section>\n<div id=\"feedback-shell\" hidden><div id=\"certificate-stage\" aria-busy=\"true\"><canvas id=\"award-certificate\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"正在准备创作奖状\"></canvas><button id=\"share-feedback\" class=\"certificate-hit certificate-share\" disabled aria-label=\"保存分享奖状\"></button><a id=\"full-report\" class=\"certificate-hit certificate-report\" href=\"/report/\" aria-label=\"查看完整报告\"></a></div><div class=\"certificate-status\"><p id=\"feedback-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">小语正在准备你的创作纪念…</p><button id=\"retry-feedback\" hidden>重新尝试</button></div></div></main>\n<dialog id=\"feedback-consent\"><h2>让小语回看这次搭建？</h2><p>生成反馈需要将本次沙具、位置、操作记录和你与小语的对话发送给 DeepSeek。不会发送摄像头图片或录音。</p><p>也可以只保留本机记录，不发送给 AI。</p><div><button id=\"feedback-local\">只用本机记录</button><button id=\"feedback-agree\">同意并生成</button></div></dialog></body></html>\n"}